WEBVTT - Seated Leg Extension Guidance

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Sit upright with your back supported and feet flat on the floor.

00:04.000 --> 00:09.000
Slowly extend your leg straight forward until your knee is comfortably straight.

00:09.000 --> 00:14.000
Hold briefly at the top to contract your quadriceps muscles firmly.

00:14.000 --> 00:19.000
Slowly and with control, lower your foot back down to the ground.

00:19.000 --> 00:25.000
Keep your upper body stable and avoid sudden kicking or jerky movements.

